WEBVTT

00:01:31.540 --> 00:01:34.300
I could never wrap
my head around it.

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:37.700
Why our friend would
turn his back on us?

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:40.520
Why he'd be so
determined to beat us?

00:01:40.520 --> 00:01:43.860
But now that he stole
Suzaku and Genbu...

00:01:44.210 --> 00:01:47.540
I don't have any
reason to hesitate!

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:50.170
I will defeat you!

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:52.560
For my friends.
For the four Sacred Beasts.

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:55.140
And for myself!

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:57.480
I've been waiting
for this, Kinomiya.

00:01:57.480 --> 00:01:59.300
Bring it, Zeo.

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:01.020
Are you ready?

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:02.320
Three!

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:03.770
No, stop...

00:02:03.770 --> 00:02:05.040
Two!

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:06.140
If he keeps this up,
Zeo's body will...

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:07.610
--One!

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:10.820
Go, Shoot!

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:18.640
Kyoujyu?

00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:22.570
What's the matter, Kyoujyu?

00:02:22.570 --> 00:02:24.050
Why are you crying?

00:02:24.050 --> 00:02:25.450
Zeo is...

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:28.250
Zeo is not human!!

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:29.140
What?!

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:32.880
Go! Burning Cerberus!

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:41.050
I will defeat Takao Kinomiya!

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:48.800
Zeo...!

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:52.480
Zeo, you're a...

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:11.930
Zeo...

00:03:14.410 --> 00:03:15.570
You're a...

00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:18.700
That's right. This is...

00:03:19.230 --> 00:03:22.090
This is what I truly am!

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:23.760
Zeo...

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:33.000
Whoa! Dragoon's
been blown back!

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:36.520
Kinomiya's in trouble!

00:03:37.180 --> 00:03:38.530
What do you mean?

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:40.990
What do you mean
he isn't human?

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:43.010
W-well...

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:44.860
Kyoujyu!

00:03:44.860 --> 00:03:47.610
Zeo... Zeo is...

00:03:48.930 --> 00:03:50.910
A robot!

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:03.090
Kinomiya is still in!
He's still in!

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:08.030
Zeo!

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:28.250
Look at this.

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:32.680
This is the noise generated when high
voltages pass through circuitry.

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:35.480
It's coming from
Zeo's body.

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:46.120
Takao!

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:07.020
What's wrong, Takao?
You can't win by running away!

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:11.990
Or are you holding back
because I'm a robot?

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:13.480
Get real!

00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:17.710
I've never held back,
not even once!

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:20.190
Then fight me
like you mean it!

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:29.680
Zeo...

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:36.570
Once my father told
me I was a robot...

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:40.520
You could never
understand how I felt.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:03.850
No way!!

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:10.340
How could I
be a robot...?

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:14.580
Zeo...

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:20.800
Dad!

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:23.180
I wasn't human.

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:28.620
I'm a robot made in
place of my dad's dead son.

00:06:32.090 --> 00:06:34.920
Zeo, don't worry.

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:37.450
You can become human.

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:43.890
If you put the power of the four Sacred Beasts in
your body, I'm sure you can become a human.

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:50.760
The four Sacred Beasts have
unlimited power hidden within them.

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:54.590
You can become
human. I promise.

00:06:56.650 --> 00:07:00.210
The only way I
can become human.

00:07:01.180 --> 00:07:06.000
Is to put the power of the four Sacred Beasts into my body!

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:14.600
So, Zagart's plan is to get
the four Sacred Beasts

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:16.680
to make Zeo human?

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:19.610
Yes. It must be that.

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:21.660
It's started again!

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:26.900
But can the four do that?

00:07:26.900 --> 00:07:30.320
It's impossible. There's
no way it can be done.

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:33.340
The four Sacred
Beasts could never...

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:35.110
I wouldn't count it out.

00:07:35.670 --> 00:07:39.500
Don't underestimate the latent
power of the four Sacred Beasts.

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:44.580
They were once the source of all life that graced the earth with their blessings.

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:48.150
At full power, there's
nothing they can't do.

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:50.860
Right. And that's why...

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:54.410
We did everything we
could to seal their power.

00:08:18.320 --> 00:08:21.530
Zeo. You will
become a human.

00:08:21.530 --> 00:08:25.770
Be reborn as a human and pave
the way for your own future.

00:09:05.630 --> 00:09:09.840
Zeo, as long as you're
giving it your all,

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:12.130
I won't run or hide.

00:09:12.410 --> 00:09:14.530
Show me what
you've got, Zeo!

00:09:16.590 --> 00:09:21.800
Cerberus!!!

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:34.000
There it is!
It's Cerberus!

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:39.100
Seiryu!!

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:49.600
Seiryu!

00:09:58.200 --> 00:09:59.740
Here I come, Zeo!

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:00.970
Hold on!

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:04.890
Behold the evolved
form of Cerberus!

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:34.650
What?!

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:37.200
Unbelievable!

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:40.390
Cerberus has absorbed Genbu
and Suzaku into its body!

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:41.610
What?!

00:10:41.610 --> 00:10:42.870
Suzaku...

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:44.160
Genbu...

00:10:55.530 --> 00:11:05.430
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:11:09.740 --> 00:11:12.880
Go, Cerberus!

00:11:23.420 --> 00:11:24.540
It's gone!

00:11:24.540 --> 00:11:26.040
Where is it?

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:27.560
Takao! Above you!

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:56.480
I expected better
from you, Takao.

00:11:57.470 --> 00:12:01.480
No need to rush.
This battle's just getting started.

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:14.120
Seiryu!

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:29.960
Takao!

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:35.430
Takao! Are you okay?

00:12:35.430 --> 00:12:36.350
Yeah...

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:38.150
What happened?

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:41.340
What about the battle?

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:42.690
Yes, sir!

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:59.100
What the heck
is going on here?

00:13:00.180 --> 00:13:01.730
What is this?

00:13:04.660 --> 00:13:09.840
Wow! The battle's continuing in the
destroyed remains of the stadium!

00:13:09.840 --> 00:13:15.000
Dragoon can't beat Cerberus with Genbu and Suzaku absorbed in it.

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:16.080
No!

00:13:16.280 --> 00:13:17.600
Ozma...

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:31.920
Takao!

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:36.840
Are you okay, Takao?

00:13:37.490 --> 00:13:40.860
I'm fine. I haven't
lost yet! Not even close!

00:13:40.860 --> 00:13:42.340
Takao!

00:13:42.620 --> 00:13:43.890
Takao...!

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:50.020
This battle is just
getting started!

00:13:53.920 --> 00:13:56.030
Dragoon!

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:02.600
Hyper Victory Tornado!

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:53.300
Zagart...

00:14:53.300 --> 00:14:55.660
You are wrong.

00:14:55.660 --> 00:15:04.050
By trying to turn a robot into a human,
you've crossed the line as a scientist.

00:15:04.050 --> 00:15:08.020
Zeo was my only
reason for living.

00:15:08.020 --> 00:15:13.100
All of that research is
finally beginning to bear fruit.

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:16.420
I won't let
anyone stop that.

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:22.570
Zeo, my beloved son.

00:15:22.570 --> 00:15:28.300
You are everything to me. I would
dive into the depths of hell for you.

00:15:28.300 --> 00:15:33.320
Defeat Seiryu, and use its
power to gain your humanity.

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:36.820
Do not think.
Do not fear.

00:15:36.820 --> 00:15:39.920
Everything is
for your future.

00:15:39.920 --> 00:15:41.750
Become human, Zeo.

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:44.690
Human...!
Human...!

00:15:48.950 --> 00:15:50.160
Father...

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:53.570
I want to become human.

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:56.210
Deep in my heart...

00:15:56.530 --> 00:15:58.980
I want to be a human
of flesh and blood!

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:01.470
You can become one.

00:16:01.470 --> 00:16:03.560
You can do it.

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:07.660
Defeat Seiryu and
become human, Zeo!

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:11.810
Zeo!

00:16:11.810 --> 00:16:14.040
Cerberus!

00:16:18.760 --> 00:16:21.490
I refuse to lose.
Dragoon!

00:16:45.160 --> 00:16:48.050
What a battle!
What a fight!

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:53.160
This is the a battle fit to determine
the number one in the world!

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:40.090
I won't lose!

00:17:42.180 --> 00:17:45.610
I will become human!

00:17:46.860 --> 00:17:48.510
Dragoon!

00:18:36.900 --> 00:18:40.340
It's over!
Takao Kinomiya wins!

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:43.260
The winner of the
world championships

00:18:43.260 --> 00:18:45.840
is Takao Kinomiya!

00:18:45.840 --> 00:18:48.840
He did it! He won!

00:18:48.840 --> 00:18:50.180
Yes, he did!

00:18:56.350 --> 00:18:57.530
Max!

00:18:58.120 --> 00:18:59.060
Kai.

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:02.160
Genbu!

00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:19.340
Genbu, you're back!

00:19:19.570 --> 00:19:20.900
Suzaku...

00:19:28.980 --> 00:19:30.640
I lost...

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:32.810
I'm completely defeated...

00:19:33.170 --> 00:19:35.440
I... I couldn't...

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:37.150
I couldn't become human...

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:38.200
Zeo.

00:19:40.380 --> 00:19:43.130
You're really strong now.

00:19:43.130 --> 00:19:44.880
It's a total shocker!

00:19:45.770 --> 00:19:52.960
When we first met at the river, I was taken by your honest desire to win.

00:19:54.560 --> 00:19:59.200
And I think that desire is
what's driven you this far.

00:19:59.200 --> 00:20:02.720
Your average human can't
work as hard as you did!

00:20:03.570 --> 00:20:05.940
Because I'm a robot...

00:20:06.170 --> 00:20:07.780
A robot, yeah...

00:20:07.780 --> 00:20:09.660
What's so wrong
with being a robot?

00:20:09.660 --> 00:20:10.540
What?

00:20:10.540 --> 00:20:15.960
I mean, you're a robot who can do
stuff humans can only dream of!

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:17.520
And that's awesome, Zeo.

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:18.810
Takao...

00:20:18.810 --> 00:20:23.420
In the stadium,
we're just Bladers.

00:20:23.420 --> 00:20:27.460
It doesn't matter if you're
a human or a robot.

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:30.950
You were strong.
Seriously.

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:37.480
Takao...!

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:46.040
Cerberus...

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:49.930
I've got Seiryu.
And you've got Cerberus.

00:20:49.930 --> 00:20:51.780
Let's battle again!

00:20:52.080 --> 00:20:54.520
Yes. Surely!

00:20:59.340 --> 00:21:06.410
Dad... In this battle, I've gained something even better than becoming human.

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:09.160
Friendship--A bond with
Takao and his friends.

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:12.980
As long as I have that I can
live my life, even as a robot!

00:21:12.980 --> 00:21:17.340
Dad, thank you
for creating me.

00:21:17.340 --> 00:21:18.560
Zeo...

00:21:20.930 --> 00:21:24.020
Our battles aren't over yet.

00:21:24.480 --> 00:21:26.560
I have Seiryu.

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:28.680
I have all these
awesome friends.

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:30.650
That's why I
can still fight.

00:21:30.650 --> 00:21:33.840
That's why I
can stay strong.
